---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import Button from '@/components/Button.astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import donationsTruck from '@/images/donations-truck.jpg';
import orangeBagLogo from '@/images/orange-bag-logo@4x.png';
import pantry from '@/images/pantry@4x.png';
import smilingPantry from '@/images/smiling-pantry@4x.png';
---

<Layout description="Learn more about how you can support Little Sunshine Pantries." title="Support">
  <section class="bg-mine-shaft-950 py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-20 px-4 pb-10 pt-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-center text-5xl font-extrabold text-satin-linen-200 sm:leading-none lg:text-6xl">
        Food insecurity is multi-faceted.
        <br />
        <em class="relative inline-flex items-end not-italic">
          <span>Our solutions need to be, too.</span>
          <svg class="absolute -bottom-6" viewBox="0 0 557.65 13.42" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path
              class="fill-pizazz-600 stroke-pizazz-600 stroke-2"
              d="M557.65,0C371.77,5.83,185.88,10.31,0,13.42"
            />
          </svg>
        </em>
      </h1>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-14 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-10">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-satin-linen-200">
            So we’re creating
            <br />
            Tallahassee’s first
            <br />
            <em class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center not-italic">
              <span class="z-10">free grocery store</span>
              <svg class="absolute -inset-1 z-0" viewBox="0 0 829.57 172.29" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path
                  class="draw fill-transparent stroke-pizazz-600 stroke-[4]"
                  d="M759.29,23.53S323.35-27.79,95.93,28.04c-227.42,55.82,19.64,128.18,98.2,134.39,78.56,6.2,509.56-15.64,580.96-38.25,62.02-19.64,69.26-55.82,20.67-75.46-35.19-14.22-307.02-35.15-510.66-29.98S6,46.64,16.33,85.92s377.31,137.49,626.44,47.55"
                  pathLength="1"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  style="--draw-duration: 1s; --draw-delay: 0.2s;"
                />
              </svg>
            </em>
          </h2>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-10">
            {/* <Button color="calypso" href="mailto:sunshinepantries@gmail.com?subject=I'd like to learn more about the free grocery store!">Get In Touch</Button> */}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="-mb-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <Image
            alt="Little Sunshine Pantries bag of oranges logo"
            class="w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm"
            src={orangeBagLogo}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col-reverse bg-calypso-600 lg:max-h-[50rem] lg:flex-row">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col justify-center px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:flex-[0_0_50%] lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-8xl font-extrabold text-satin-linen-200" id="food-pantries">
        Food
        <br />
        pantries
      </h2>
      <div>
        <p class="my-8 font-semibold text-mine-shaft-950">
          Since 2022, we’ve been creating direct access to food and other essentials for those in Tallahassee who
          need it the most by regularly stocking
          {' '}
          <em class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center not-italic">
            <span class="z-10">19 pantries.</span>
            <svg
              class="absolute inset-0 z-0"
              viewBox="0 0 163.38 51.61"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            >
              <path
                class="draw-load fill-transparent stroke-satin-linen-200 stroke-2"
                d="M140.66,3.91S27.1-5.68,6.41,13.06C-14.28,31.8,27.05,45.8,85.71,47.8c58.66,2,76.36-8.65,76.67-21.33.54-22.18-55.55-24.82-98.11-22.08S6.62,12.9,9.17,27.02c2.55,14.12,36.16,24.89,96.1,23.46,59.23-1.41,58.71-29.07,45.8-35.12C131.68,6.25,67.3-15.01,5.59,22.11"
                pathLength="1"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                style="--draw-duration: 1s;"
              />
            </svg>
          </em>
        </p>
        <p class="my-8 font-semibold text-mine-shaft-950">
          We use the money you donate to purchase
          <br />
          <em class="relative inline-flex items-end justify-end not-italic">
            <span class="z-10">1food, hygiene supplies, and bus passes</span>
            <svg
              class="absolute -bottom-2 z-0"
              viewBox="0 0 466.66 13.51"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            >
              <path
                class="draw-load fill-transparent stroke-satin-linen-200 stroke-2"
                d="M465.66,1.03S170.44-.12,1,12.51c0,0,318.77-11.49,462.94-4.02,0,0-240.08,1.15-322.79,3.45"
                pathLength="1"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                style="--draw-duration: 1s;"
              />
            </svg>
          </em>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <Button color="satin-linen" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Z9V9GXBFBSRJJ">PayPal</Button>
        <Button color="satin-linen" href="https://account.venmo.com/u/sunshine_pantries">Venmo</Button>
        <Button color="satin-linen" href="https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/2JR201AT70B6Q/ref=hz_ls_biz_ex"><span class="whitespace-nowrap">Amazon Wishlist</span></Button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:flex-[0_0_50%]">
      <Image alt="A Little Sunshine Pantry" class="size-full object-cover" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" src={pantry} widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1920]} />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flex flex-col bg-satin-linen-200 lg:max-h-[50rem] lg:flex-row">
    <div class="lg:flex-[0_0_50%]">
      <Image alt="truck full of donations" class="size-full object-cover" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" src={donationsTruck} widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1920]} />
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col justify-center px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:flex-[0_0_50%] lg:px-8">
      <div class="relative">
        <Image
          alt="smiling pantry illustration"
          class="mb-10 h-auto w-40 md:absolute md:-right-10 md:-top-5 md:mb-0"
          src={smilingPantry}
        />
        <h2 class="relative text-8xl font-extrabold text-pizazz-600">
          <span class="relative">
            Want to
            <br />
            become a
            <br />
            partner?
          </span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="my-8 font-semibold text-mine-shaft-950">
          As a partner, you can adopt your very own pantry and help us keep it filled with weekly donations of the essentials we stock them with.
        </p>
        <p class="my-8 font-semibold text-mine-shaft-950">
          Who can become a partner? Individuals! Organizations! Schools! Collectives! Businesses! YOU!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <Button color="pizazz" href="mailto:sunshinepantries@gmail.com?subject=I'd like to partner with you!&body=Hello, I'd like to become a partner by...">Get Started</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
